  m_text: Balance a giant suspended deck above the quarry. Drive uphill to counter
    a tilt, spread out, and ram rivals toward the edges. Earn +1 for every 15 seconds
    survived, +2 when you help level a heavily tilted board by moving uphill, +3
    for a credited knockoff, and +5 for sole survival. Heats last up to 90 seconds.
    If several trucks survive the timer, they share the heat without a sole-survivor
    bonus. Choose one, three or five heats; highest total wins and equal totals share
    placing. Solo is a 90-second balance challenge. Falling trucks crash into the
    quarry. RECOVER works only when you are stuck or overturned on the board. Choose
    a shared arena, chase or full-cab view; camera switch, free look, horn and actual
    device bindings are shown in Pause. Your Crew names/colors, selected weather
    and optional AI cameras carry through the match. Watch the final moments again
    from Results.
